WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.446
[MUSIC]

00:00:07.453 --> 00:00:11.427
SPEAKER: Some people oppose
inheritance taxes on the grounds

00:00:11.427 --> 00:00:14.836
that wealthy parents should
be able, when they die,

00:00:14.836 --> 00:00:19.110
to leave their money and possessions
to their children if they wish.

00:00:19.110 --> 00:00:22.640
Others favor inheritance
taxes on the grounds

00:00:22.644 --> 00:00:27.376
that it is unfair for some children
to start out life with substantially

00:00:27.376 --> 00:00:30.226
more resources than others.

00:00:30.234 --> 00:00:31.879
What do you think?

00:00:31.879 --> 00:00:36.632
Are steep inheritance taxes
on the wealthy just or unjust?

00:00:36.632 --> 00:00:41.552
[MUSIC]

